msgid "自行部署旧版模型"
msgstr "Self-hosted legacy models"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:26
msgid "使用旧版模型 JSON 或旧版模型 API。"
msgstr "Use a classic model JSON file or classic model API."

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:36
msgid "Pro 未安装或尚未启用"
msgstr "Pro is not installed or activated"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:37
msgid "Pro 与基础插件版本不兼容"
msgstr "Pro is incompatible with the base plugin"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:38
msgid "Pro 已安装，请使用有对应权益的官网账号完成授权；升级账号后请在登录页重新保存 Key 刷新权益。"
msgstr "Pro is installed. Bind an eligible account; after upgrading your account, save its Key again on the login tab to refresh entitlement."

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:39
msgid "Pro 已启用"
msgstr "Pro is enabled"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:41
msgid "增强插件状态不可用"
msgstr "Add-on status is unavailable"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:44
msgid "免费基础版与 Pro 增强版"
msgstr "Free base plugin and Pro add-on"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:45
msgid "为区分旧版 Live2D 与依赖 Cubism Core 的新版模型，并分别管理许可和分发，插件现拆分为免费基础版与 Pro 增强版。旧版模型和共同功能保留在免费版；新版模型由 Pro 提供。"
msgstr "The plugin is split into Free and Pro to separate classic Live2D from modern models requiring Cubism Core and manage their licensing and distribution separately. Classic models and shared features remain in Free; Pro provides modern models."

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:46
msgid "此次拆分不会主动删除已有模型、设置或授权数据。已购用户请使用原账号前往官网确认对应权益并获取 Pro，不需要为同一权益重复付款。"
msgstr "The split does not delete existing models, settings or account data. Existing customers can use their original account on the official website to confirm entitlement and get Pro without buying the same entitlement again."

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:48
msgid "前往官网获取 Pro"
msgstr "Get Pro from the official website"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:50
msgid "上传 Pro 增强补丁"
msgstr "Upload the Pro add-on"

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:53
msgid "下载 Pro ZIP 后，点击上传按钮进入 WordPress 官方安装页，上传并启用补丁。版本与账号权益验证通过后，本设置页会显示 Pro 功能；无需替换 Free。请勿将付费文件直接覆盖到 Free 目录。"
msgstr "After downloading the Pro ZIP, use the upload button to open the standard WordPress installer, then upload and activate it. Pro features appear here once compatibility and account entitlement are verified. Keep Free installed; do not overwrite its directory with paid files."

#: src/live2d-Extensions.php:58
msgid "已保存的模型类型当前不可用。原配置和模型保持不变；请启用兼容且已授权的 Pro 后恢复，不会自动替换为其他角色。"
msgstr "The saved model type is unavailable. Its configuration and files are retained. Activate compatible, authorized Pro to restore it; no replacement character is selected."

